~ start
% [if not EventFlags.get_flag("X-Az-Den-1")] => convo_1
% [if not EventFlags.get_flag("X-Az-Den-2")] => convo_2
% [if not EventFlags.get_flag("X-Az-Den-3")] => convo_3
% [if not EventFlags.get_flag("X-Az-Den-4")] => convo_4
% [if EventFlags.num_den_conversations == 4] => ending_convo
=> END


~ convo_1
Az: Where are you from?
Fenn starry: [font_size=60][wave freq=7 amp=20 connected=0][color="0B4F4A"]Navetta[/color]![/wave][/font_size]
Az: Hm. Never heard of it. Where is it?
Fenn: It's north. Lots of trees and farms and stuff.
Az: Ah, countryside?
Fenn: Yeah! 
Fenn worry: [speed=0.8]Not a lot of people[wait=0.3] to talk to.
do EventFlags.set_flag("X-Az-Den-1", true)
do EventFlags.num_den_conversations += 1
=> END

~ convo_2
Fenn starry: Have you met [color="B80006"]Adira[/color]? Knight of Cloth? [wave freq=7 amp=30]She's my favorite![/wave]
Az: [i]Her?[/i] Yikes...
Fenn worry: Huh? Why? What's wrong with [color="B80006"]Adira[/color]?
Az: I mean, [i]nothing[/i]... 
do EventBus.interrupt_dialogue.emit("0.3")
Az annoy: If you don't mind Knights who are shallow, conceited, pieces of-
Fenn worry: [font_size=80][shake level=8 rate=30]WHAT?![/shake][/font_size]
Az: Sorry to break it to you, kid. [color="B80006"]Adira[/color] is... kinda terrible.
Fenn: Really?
Az: Hey, don't worry about it! Most of 'em are fine. [color="B80006"]Adira[/color] [i]specifically[/i] is terrible.
Fenn worry: Aw...
do EventFlags.set_flag("X-Az-Den-2", true)
do EventFlags.num_den_conversations += 1
=> END

~ convo_3
Az: How come you know a lot about the Knights and stuff?
Fenn starry: Who [i]wouldn't[/i] want to know about the Knights?! [wave freq=7 amp=30]They're the coolest![/wave]
Az: I dunno. I've never seen someone so enthusiastic about them.
Fenn : But they do so many awesome things! 
Fenn starry: They go on adventures! Slay [shake level=7 rate=20]monsters![/shake] [font_size=60][wave freq=7 amp=30]Save princesses![/wave][/font_size]
Az: Fenn, I don't think there's been a princess that needed saving in,[wait=0.3] like,[wait=0.3] at least a century
Fenn: But... but...
Az laugh: Nah, don't worry. I get it.
Az: I remember when [color="B80006"]Baba[/color] became a Knight. It was pretty cool.
do EventFlags.set_flag("X-Az-Den-3", true)
do EventFlags.num_den_conversations += 1
=> END

~ convo_4
Fenn: Do you make a lot of bracelet things?
Az: Bangles?
Fenn: Yeah!! [wait=0.3]Bracelet things.
Az: No, not often. These gold ones took me [i]weeks[/i] to get the inscriptions just right.
Az: Though, if I want to make one fast, I use copper or aluminum.
Fenn starry: [font_size=60][shake level=7 rate=30]REALLY?![/shake] Could I have one?[/font_size]
Az: Uh, yeah,[wait=0.3] sure. Later, though.
Fenn starry: [font_size=60]YAY! [wave freq=7 amp=20]I can't wait.[/wave] [/font_size]
do EventFlags.set_flag("X-Az-Den-4", true)
do EventFlags.num_den_conversations += 1
=> END

~ ending_convo
Az: Alright, let's go. We've got a [color="8A0194"]Wizard[/color] to deal with.
=> END
